{"ID":"20240314091741-x8cu4ga","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091741-x8cu4ga","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091741-x8cu4ga\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171345-bevorrr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171345-yh86kiz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171345-yh86kiz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:69,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:69\u0026#125;","title":"【半夏厚朴汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171345-bevorrr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-bevorrr","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人咽中如有炙脔，半夏厚朴汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-npkue8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-npkue8u","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏厚朴汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-cda8d7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-cda8d7d","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏一升厚朴三两茯苓四两生姜五两苏叶二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-g68dive","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-g68dive","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水一斗，煑取四升，分服四服，日三夜一服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-p4l5uxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-p4l5uxq","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个条辩呢，半夏厚朴汤我用的很多，跟这个后面的甘麦大枣汤都是很普遍的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-zywtuad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-zywtuad","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个半夏厚朴汤呢，诸位看，他写的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"妇人咽中如有炙腐"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是喉咙里面有个梅核气物一直哽在那边，或者是很热，好像有烧灼感在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"或者是我刚才讲的，梅核气怎么咳怎么吞，就是喉咙里面有东西挡到了，这个叫做半夏厚朴汤证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-so6xjtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-so6xjtc","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么临床上的时候有个很特殊的症状，你们听到这个症状就可以开这个药，就是病人会跟你陈述哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"“我好像觉得有人把我的心脏抓住，握到我的心脏”，这个就是半夏厚朴汤证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。为什么是这样子？你看这个处方，所以大家最好了解一下方义。我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用茯苓跟生姜，这为什么这样做？因为胃中有停水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们会有生姜，有半夏对不对，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用半夏为什么？祛痰祛水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个半夏呢除了祛水以外还祛痰。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-7xpsf8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-7xpsf8w","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴呢能够行气，我们喉咙这边呢，人的喉部是气脉所经过的地方，所以我们常常会使用到厚朴。那半夏呢，是涤痰，祛他的痰，茯苓呢，祛他的水，这个苏叶呢，能够行肺气，肺的气。如果你用的是麻黄，麻黄是发表，就是整个肺在动，如果你只用在喉咙这边的时候，用苏叶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-oc7tndn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-oc7tndn","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个药除了用在这个地方，太太小姐喉咙常常哽到一块东西哦，就是因为气挡到了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实际上她没有东西在里面，是个痰在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么张仲景在妇人篇才提出来？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为这个以前呢，这个太太住在房子里面，很少出门的，都闷在房子里面。不能随便出门哦，因为门窗一打开，一看到有个男的在外面，给那男的看到你就要嫁给他。那万一那个男的很丑呢？对不对。“我不要嫁给他！”，但是谁让你被看到了。以前的规矩很多，所以说太太们只能闷在家里面做刺绣啊一些的工作，那闷在里面就得到了这种问题。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"想得太多，或者情绪比较郁闷，都会有这种情况"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-3z38cpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-3z38cpd","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那半夏厚朴汤呢，你看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏重用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏五钱，厚朴三钱，茯苓四钱，生姜三片，苏叶两钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。苏叶非常的轻，所以它的两钱已经一大包了，你不要说，哎呀这个半夏比较多，实际上你看苏叶两钱比半夏五钱的量还大很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171345-yh86kiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171345-yh86kiz","updated":"20240422171345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你如果听到一个太太跟你说，“哎呀，奇怪了，我这个吃东西都没有问题，可使喉咙里老是感觉有个东西”，就是她已经告诉你了，你给我半夏厚朴汤。"}]}]}